# Multimedia Appendix 3. Clinical utility, sample characteristics, and sensitivity analyses

All estimates complex-survey weighted. Supports Results ＝3.1 (participant characteristics and depression-module non-response, Tables S6 and S10), ＝3.6 (parsimonious deployment model, Table S8), ＝3.7 (sensitivity analyses, Table S7), and ＝3.8 (fairness and clinical utility, Tables S1, S4, S5 and S9). The model is positioned as a screening/triage aid, not a diagnostic instrument.

## Table S1. Operating characteristics at reference thresholds

The Youden point is computed over all observed scores rather than a coarse threshold grid. Thresholds are selected and evaluated in the same cohort, so these operating characteristics are apparent rather than out-of-sample.

| Set | Threshold | Value | Sensitivity | Specificity | PPV | NPV |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Internal | Youden (exact) | 0.0333 | 0.730 | 0.780 | 0.110 | 0.987 |
| Internal | prevalence | 0.0360 | 0.706 | 0.797 | 0.115 | 0.986 |
| NHANES pre | Youden (exact) | 0.0355 | 0.733 | 0.687 | 0.178 | 0.965 |
| NHANES pre | prevalence | 0.0845 | 0.529 | 0.841 | 0.234 | 0.951 |
| NHANES post | Youden (exact) | 0.0282 | 0.739 | 0.667 | 0.236 | 0.948 |
| NHANES post | prevalence | 0.1220 | 0.407 | 0.912 | 0.392 | 0.917 |

## Table S4. Triage-oriented high-sensitivity operating points

At sensitivity fixed to 0.85 and 0.90, the table gives specificity, positive and negative predictive value, the share of the population flagged, and the number needed to screen (NNS = 1/PPV). Thresholds are chosen and evaluated in the same cohort, so these are apparent operating characteristics. The 5-item deployment model and the 7-item post hoc variant are both shown alongside the full 17-predictor model.

| Model | Set | Target | Specificity | PPV | NPV | Flag rate | NNS |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 17-predictor | Internal | sens 0.85 | 0.616 | 0.076 | 0.991 | 0.400 | 13.1 |
| 17-predictor | Internal | sens 0.90 | 0.505 | 0.064 | 0.993 | 0.509 | 15.7 |
| 17-predictor | NHANES pre | sens 0.85 | 0.524 | 0.142 | 0.974 | 0.507 | 7.1 |
| 17-predictor | NHANES pre | sens 0.90 | 0.394 | 0.121 | 0.977 | 0.631 | 8.3 |
| 17-predictor | NHANES post | sens 0.85 | 0.486 | 0.187 | 0.959 | 0.555 | 5.4 |
| 17-predictor | NHANES post | sens 0.90 | 0.385 | 0.169 | 0.965 | 0.649 | 5.9 |
| 5-item | Internal | sens 0.85 | 0.563 | 0.068 | 0.990 | 0.452 | 14.8 |
| 5-item | Internal | sens 0.90 | 0.451 | 0.058 | 0.992 | 0.562 | 17.3 |
| 5-item | NHANES pre | sens 0.85 | 0.436 | 0.122 | 0.969 | 0.589 | 8.2 |
| 5-item | NHANES pre | sens 0.90 | 0.327 | 0.110 | 0.973 | 0.692 | 9.1 |
| 5-item | NHANES post | sens 0.85 | 0.421 | 0.170 | 0.953 | 0.612 | 5.9 |
