docs\manuscript_17var.md-86-### 2.13 Data-integrity audit
docs\manuscript_17var.md-87-An adversarial audit corrected three silent data-processing defects before final analysis: (1) living-alone fabricated to a constant in NHANES pre (DMDHHSIZ absent → constant imputation) — corrected to preserve missingness; (2) NHANES post physical-activity coded 0 for all respondents due to string-typed unit fields mis-parsed to NaN — corrected with explicit unit mapping; (3) an income refusal code (77777) not treated as missing, placing non-respondents in the top income quintile — corrected. These affected data integrity but not the substantive conclusions.
