codex
The independent recomputations now confirm two implementation-level errors, not just reporting gaps: the KCHS singleton-pooling code collapses 17,085 original singleton clusters to 5,956 because reused PSU labels are merged, changing the internal 95% CI; and the PSU-overlap calculation omits survey year, changing the reported record overlap from 92.0% to 91.8%. External NHANES CIs are not affected by the singleton-label collision because those strata have no singletons.
Numeric tables, code paths, Korean pre-specification/SAP/protocol, figures, and verifier have been inspected; independent recomputations identified implementation and reporting defects. Consolidating and checking exact quotations/corrections now.
  ✓ Inventory submission, authoritative results, code, and figure references
  ✓ Audit numeric fidelity and rounding across all documents
